The following persons are exempted from payment of the passenger service charge referred to in section 2 -

(a) any member of the operating crew of any aircraft;

(b) any passenger boarding any of the following class of

(i) Brunei Darussalam military aircraft;

(ii) British military aircraft used for military purposes;

(iii) foreign diplomatic aircraft engaged on diplomatic or consular missions to Brunei Darussalam;

